The following information in my credit file is the result of a clear FCRA violation and must be blocked immediately : XXXX XXXX XXXX Account XXXX. XXXX XXXX XXXX Account XXXX. XXXX Additionally, 15 U.S.C. 1681b states that a credit reporting agency may not include information in a consumers file unless there is a valid authorization or permissible purpose. I never authorized the opening or reporting of these accounts, and there is no signed contract or consent from me that justifies their inclusion in my credit report. 

