XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX  : Late payment despite hardship request Law : FCRA 1681e ( b ), FDCPA 806 creditor failed to apply hardship protection Story : During a medical emergency, I notified the creditor requesting forbearance or payment flexibility. They denied me assistance and marked the account late, showing disregard for my situation. This act was predatory and hurt my credit unfairly. 
XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX  Date Opened : XX/XX/XXXX High Credit : {$1400.00} XXXX XXXX  Issue : False late payment entry Law : FCRA 1681i ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ) consumer may dispute completeness or accuracy Story : My records show payment was made in time. The creditor refused to correct the report after multiple disputes. Ive suffered denials for job roles requiring credit checks because of this derogatory entry. 
XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX Date Opened : XX/XX/XXXX High Credit : {$1400.00} * * Issue : Late payment reported during a payment arrangement Law : FCRA 1681s-2 ( b ) ( XXXX ) ( D ) if information is inaccurate or can not be verified, it must be corrected or deleted Story : I entered a hardship agreement due to temporary income loss. The account should have been protected. Instead, they marked me late and destroyed my payment history unfairly. 
XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX  Date Opened : XX/XX/XXXX High Credit : {$430.00} * * Issue : Repeated inaccurate late payment claims Law : FCRA 1681e ( b ) Story : This account reflects a pattern of misreporting by the creditor. I requested review and correction, but it was ignored. Its affecting my rental applications and job offers. This must be deleted. 
