15072841,2025-08-04,Debt collection,Other debt,Attempts to collect debt not owed,Debt is not yours,"CFPB Complaint - National Credit Adjusters , LLC Willful Violations of FCRA and FDCPA : Failure to Respond to Consumer Disputes and Federal Oversight SUMMARY OF VIOLATIONS I am filing this escalated complaint against National Credit Adjusters , LLC ( NCA ) for systematic violations of federal consumer protection laws, including willful failure to respond to legally mandated dispute processes, CFPB oversight, and debt validation requirements under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) and Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ). 
