Violation : NCA received certified mail dispute on XX/XX/XXXX, containing clear notice of : Identity theft with supporting FTC documentation Request for investigation under 623 ( b ) ( 1 ) Demand for cessation of reporting pending verification Willful Nature : NCA 's complete silence for 30+ days demonstrates willful disregard for statutory obligations, not mere negligence.

