Violation : NCA failed to provide : Verification of debt amount and creditor identity Copy of original creditor agreement Proof of authority to collect alleged debt Any response whatsoever to validation request Legal Consequence : Under FDCPA 809 ( b ), failure to validate renders continued reporting and collection activity per se violations. 
