XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX  Date Opened : XX/XX/XXXX Balance Owed : {$890.00} Chargeoff * * LAW : FCRA XXXX, FDCPA XXXX ( b ) ISSUE : Unverified Charge-Off STORY : I do not recall opening this account or authorizing credit from this creditor. This charge-off is unverified and must be substantiated with a signed contract or original application. Otherwise, remove it. 

XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX Date Opened : XX/XX/XXXX Balance Owed : {$880.00} Late Payment * * LAW : FCRA XXXX, XXXX ( b ) ISSUE : Late Payment Reporting Within 30 Days of Opening STORY : This account reflects a late payment shortly after it was opened, which is suspicious and potentially erroneous. I challenge the accuracy of this record and demand verification or deletion. 

MB FIN SVCS XXXX * * * * * Date Opened : XX/XX/XXXX Balance Owed : {$19000.00} Chargeoff * * LAW : FCRA XXXX, FDCPA XXXX ( b ) ISSUE : Large Balance Charge-Off Not Validated STORY : This charge-off is not familiar, and I request all supporting documentation including payment history, original agreement, and itemized statements. Without this, remove the account. 

