XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XX/XX/XXXX Inquiry LAW : FCRA XXXX, XXXX ISSUE : Hard Inquiry Without Consumer Knowledge STORY : This inquiry appears without my knowledge or permission. There is no application or agreement supporting this access. Please delete this unauthorized access. 

