15105412,2025-08-06,Mortgage,Conventional home mortgage,Trouble during payment process,Loan sold or transferred to another company,"This complaint details a series of predatory and obstructive practices by Fay Servicing and the current loan investor concerning the property located at XXXX, NY. These actions have demonstrably jeopardized my investment, inflated my debt, and appear designed to force an unjust foreclosure. 

