Current Claimed Owner : LVNV Funding LLC Reference Number : XXXX Dear Resurgent Capital Services, This letter serves as my XXXX  formal request for full and proper validation of the alleged debt referenced above. My first request was sent by certified mail on XX/XX/year>, under tracking number XXXX. To date, I have not received any adequate documentation or response satisfying the legal requirements under the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ). 
