I am requesting that Rocket Mortgage review my case for an affordable hardship modification or accommodation that maintains my current 3.25 % rate and reduces my monthly obligation through partial forbearance, principal deferment, or term extension without increasing the interest rate or adding excessive costs. 

My HUD-certified housing counselor at XXXX XXXX is assisting me and can confirm my hardship and request for imminent default assistance. 

