Account : XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX  Date Account Reported : XX/XX/year> I am filing this complaint because Sunrise Credit Services , Inc. is attempting to collect a debt allegedly owed to XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX without providing proper validation, and has engaged in misleading and unprofessional conduct. 

