Story : This entry shows a delinquency that never happened. I have proof of payments, but your system continues to show me as late. This has prevented me from being approved for a mortgage with competitive rates, costing me thousands in potential interest savings. 
XXXX Account # XXXX XXXX XXXX : {$14000.00} Charge-off * * Issue : Debt marked as charged-off in error. 
