15344572,2025-08-18,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Investigation took more than 30 days,"I am a victim of identity theft. Fraudsters opened multiple accounts in my name without my knowledge or consent.

