They can not report ANY trace of fraudulent accounts - not as open, not as closed, not at all.

Under 15 U.S.C. 1681i ( a ), they must conduct reasonable reinvestigation and delete inaccurate information within 30 days.

Under 15 U.S.C. 1681e ( b ), they must maintain maximum possible accuracy in credit reports.

