Story : This address has never been associated with me in any capacity. Its reporting on my credit file creates confusion for creditors and risks identity misattribution. Reporting an address I have never used is a clear violation of the FCRA, leading to potential financial harm and misdirected correspondence. The continual presence of this erroneous address on my report demonstrates negligence on the part of the credit reporting agency and any furnishers who provided this data. 
