15472586,2025-08-24,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Virtual currency,Other transaction problem,,"Subject : Formal Complaint Against Coinbase , Inc. for Failure to Prevent Unauthorized Transactions and Resulting Financial Loss To : Consumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ) Consumer Name : XXXX XXXX Email Associated with Coinbase : XXXX Coinbase Support Case Number ( XXXX ) : # XXXX, # XXXX, # XXXX, # XXXX by email I am writing to file a formal complaint against Coinbase , Inc. for gross negligence in managing a security breach on my account, which resulted in a direct financial loss of {$17000.00} USD. Despite my timely notification and their stated security procedures, Coinbase failed to take the necessary actions to stop fraudulent transfers that were in a "" pending '' status. 

